n the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/battle-of-diu-1509">Battle of Diu</a></span></li><li><span class="rf-year">1527</span><span class="rf-text">Bahadur Shah ascends the throne and expands the kingdom</span></li><li><span class="rf-year">1535</span><span class="rf-text">The Mughal emperor <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/humayun">Humayun</a> attacks <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/gujarat">Gujarat</a> and briefly occupies it</span></li><li><span class="rf-year">1537</span><span class="rf-text">Bahadur Shah is killed by the Portuguese while making a deal with them</span></li><li><span class="rf-year">1573</span><span class="rf-text"><a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/akbar">Akbar</a> annexes the Gujarat Sultanate and Muzaffar Shah III is taken prisoner to <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/agra">Agra</a></span></li></ol>
